---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base
  title="Privacy policy"
  description="How we handle data on this site. Short version: we don't collect any personally identifying information."
  breadcrumbs={[
    { name: 'Home', url: '/' },
    { name: 'Privacy policy', url: '/privacy/' },
  ]}
>
  <article class="legal-page">
    <h1>Privacy policy</h1>
    <p class="last-updated"><em>Last updated: 2026-05-13</em></p>

    <h2>Short version</h2>
    <p>
      We don't collect personal data. We don't use cookies. We don't sell
      anything to anyone. We use privacy-respecting analytics that don't
      fingerprint or track you across sites.
    </p>

    <h2>What we actually do</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>
        <strong>Server logs.</strong> Cloudflare (our hosting provider)
        automatically logs basic request metadata such as timestamp,
        approximate country, and browser type for security and
        infrastructure purposes. We do not access these logs to identify
        individuals.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Analytics.</strong> We use Cloudflare Web Analytics, a
        privacy-preserving analytics product. It does not set cookies,
        does not fingerprint users, and does not perform cross-site
        tracking. It reports aggregate page-view counts without
        identifying individuals.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Affiliate links.</strong> When you click a product link
        to Amazon or another retailer, that destination site may set its
        own cookies on its own domain. We have no access to or control
        over those cookies. Refer to the destination site's privacy
        policy for details. As an Amazon Associate, we earn from
        qualifying purchases.
      </li>
    </ul>

    <h2>What we don't do</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>We don't collect names, email addresses, or any personally identifying information from visitors.</li>
      <li>We don't have user accounts, logins, or comment systems.</li>
      <li>We don't display third-party advertising networks.</li>
      <li>We don't sell, rent, or share visitor data with any third party.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Affiliate disclosure</h2>
    <p>
      Many product links on this site are affiliate links. If you click
      such a link and make a qualifying purchase, we may earn a small
      commission at no additional cost to you. As an Amazon Associate,
      we earn from qualifying purchases. Affiliate revenue funds the
      site and allows us to keep it free of paid advertising.
    </p>

    <h2>Children</h2>
    <p>
      This site is not directed to children under 13, and we do not
      knowingly collect any information from children.
    </p>

    <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
    <p>
      We may update this policy as the site evolves. Material changes
      will be reflected by a new "last updated" date at the top of this
      page. We recommend reviewing this policy periodically.
    </p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>
      Questions or concerns about this policy can be sent to
      <a href="mailto:hello@baristapath.com">hello@baristapath.com</a>.
      <em>(Email forwarding will be configured shortly after launch.)</em>
    </p>
  </article>
</Base>

<style>
  .legal-page {
    max-width: 720px;
    margin: 2rem auto 4rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }
  .legal-page h1 {
    margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
  }
  .legal-page .last-updated {
    margin-top: 0;
    color: #666;
  }
  .legal-page h2 {
    margin-top: 2rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }
  .legal-page ul {
    padding-left: 1.25rem;
  }
  .legal-page li {
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }
</style>
